# Two coupled Zeldovich exchange reactions (forward only); the B-style
# reverses are generated at run time by "react_modify reverse auto".
# They share species NO, O, N, so the two reverse reactions compete for
# the same reactants -- a multi-channel detailed-balance test.  Forward
# parameters are from data/air.tce.
#
#   R1:  N2 + O <-> NO + N
#   R2:  NO + O <-> O2 + N

N2 + O --> NO + N
E A 0.0 5.175e-19 1.069e-12 -1.0 -5.175e-19

NO + O --> O2 + N
E A 0.0 2.684e-19 1.389e-17 0.0 -2.684e-19
